//! The handler module of `03-host-and-client-over-tcp.protos`. It is not a
//! lesson on its own: the embedding host installs it as `app:hello`.
//!
//! `std:http/Host` never receives a Closure. Each Worker Actor imports its own
//! instance of this module by name and calls its `handle` binding, so nothing
//! mutable is shared between Workers.

/// Greets the request target, for example "Hello, /world".
handle: (request) => {
    response: {
        status: 200
        headers: [["Content-Type", Encoding.Latin1.encode("text/plain; charset=utf-8")]]
        body: Encoding.UTF8.encode("Hello, " + Encoding.Latin1.decode(request.target))
    }
    response
}
